{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"27日は、「劇場版BAD BOYS J―最後に守るもの―」の完成披露プレミア上映会がありました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての舞台挨拶はすごく緊張しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵な映画ですし、乃木坂46としても初の映画出演ですので是非ともたくさんの方に観て頂けたらいいなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/09/29/0657477/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真崎奈緒でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日はGirls Awardに出演してきました(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/09/29/0657477/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことに、今回で三回目の出演！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVEでは制服のマネキン、おいでシャンプー、ガールズルールの三曲を披露させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子の憧れがいっぱいのステージに、こうやって立たせて頂くことができて本当に嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVEを終えてからは、ランウェイ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は乃木坂から9人歩かせてもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三回目のランウェイと言いつつも、緊張したことには変わりなく...でも、たくさんの声援が聞こえてすっごく嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またランウェイ出れるといいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/09/29/0657477/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の衣装☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次も乃木坂46でパフォーマンスできるよう、今まで以上に頑張りたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、東北楽天ゴールデンイーグルスさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パ・リーグ優勝おめでとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二度もの始球式をありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お忙しい中、田中投手からの投球指導は本当に感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちも頑張らないとっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは...今日はこれから握手会です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来られる方は後で会いましょう♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/09/29/0657477/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}